    Only `probe-emend-edit-xml` links `quick-xml`, as `probe-zip-xml` does, so
    its delta over `probe-zip-xml` is what emend adds to a consumer that already
    carries both crates and reads entries. The other two emend probes' deltas
    over `probe-zip-xml` subtract `quick-xml` and are not that figure.
    
    Between the emend probes:
    
    | Difference | Section bytes | .text bytes | File bytes |
    | --- | --- | --- | --- |
